The '''Cosmic Energy''' is one of the [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]s. Like the [[Energy Core]], which it stacks with, it increases the damage dealt by the [[Cat Cannon]].

==Effect==
Each Cosmic Energy increases Cat Cannon ATK by a maximum +500.

When a player has activated Cosmic Energy at 100% in all three chapters, Cat Cannon ATK is increased by +1,500.

